 r←Test_Input_Misc_004(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;DT;defMat;globalParms;parms;focusHas
⍝ Exercise "Input" with the "ForceFocusTo" method.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 5⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Char1' '' 'APL is great'DT.Character 0
 defMat⍪←'Char2' '' 'Python is okay'DT.Character 0
 defMat⍪←'Char3' '' 'COBOL is ... arrrgh!'DT.Character 0

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.size←370 380
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo

 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 ∆Process n.∆Form

 n #._APLGUI.GUI.Input.ForceFocusTo'Char3'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 focusHas←2 ⎕NQ'#' 'GetFocusObj'
 →GoToTidyUp~∧/n.∆Form.Size∊¨(parms.size-5)+¨⊂⍳10
 n.∆CloseForm

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
